00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:09.000
It is entirely built on duration.

215
00:07:09.000 --> 00:07:11.400
It's like a ladder constructed out of time.

216
00:07:11.400 --> 00:07:12.360
But why?

217
00:07:12.360 --> 00:07:14.040
Why does the diagnostic system

218
00:07:14.040 --> 00:07:16.200
care so much about a calendar?

219
00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:18.000
Like let me walk up this ladder first.

220
00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:20.360
If someone has psychotic symptoms, delusions,

221
00:07:20.360 --> 00:07:22.840
hallucinations, maybe disorganized speech.

