00:08:43.160 --> 00:08:46.240
without a major mood episode running alongside it.

265
00:08:46.240 --> 00:08:48.500
Wait, so the psychosis basically has to stand

266
00:08:48.500 --> 00:08:51.120
on its own two feet for a couple of weeks

267
00:08:51.120 --> 00:08:52.720
to prove it's a separate entity

268
00:08:52.720 --> 00:08:53.960
rather than just being

269
00:08:53.960 --> 00:08:56.400
like a really severe feature of the depression.

270
00:08:56.400 --> 00:08:58.040
Exactly, that freestanding stretch

271
00:08:58.040 --> 00:09:00.400
of altered reality is the separator.

272
00:09:00.400 --> 00:09:03.000
It proves the psychotic engine can run independently.

273
00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:05.160
Okay, so we have timelines for reality.

274
00:09:05.160 --> 00:09:07.960
But what about when people are detached from others?

275
00:09:07.960 --> 00:09:12.040
The way personality styles are categorized is wild to me.

276
00:09:12.040 --> 00:09:13.040
It's very nuanced.

277
00:09:13.040 --> 00:09:15.920
Let's take someone who is just a total loner.

278
00:09:15.920 --> 00:09:17.120
If you're at a party

