00:12:52.280 --> 00:12:53.280
No, they feel distressed

384
00:12:53.280 --> 00:12:54.920
when other people don't follow their rules.

385
00:12:54.920 --> 00:12:55.760
Ah.

386
00:12:55.760 --> 00:12:57.800
They believe their way is the objectively

387
00:12:57.800 --> 00:12:58.720
correct way to live.

388
00:12:58.720 --> 00:13:01.280
There were no unwanted intrusive obsessions,

389
00:13:01.280 --> 00:13:03.360
no neutralizing compulsions,

390
00:13:03.360 --> 00:13:06.000
just this deeply ingrained need for control.

391
00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:07.360
Wow, okay.

392
00:13:07.360 --> 00:13:09.560
Let's shift gears from the architecture of the mind

