00:16:53.580 --> 00:16:55.480
the severe withdrawal-like cravings,

500
00:16:55.480 --> 00:16:57.600
it perfectly mimics substance use

501
00:16:57.600 --> 00:17:00.080
without a chemical ever entering the bloodstream.

502
00:17:00.080 --> 00:17:02.080
That is wild.

503
00:17:02.080 --> 00:17:04.880
But I guess the physical manifestations of mental health

504
00:17:04.880 --> 00:17:07.840
